---
layout: app-shell.njk
permalink: /remember/
title: "What I remember | Stefanos Tzortzoglou"
bodyScripts:
  - src: "/scripts/remember.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/contact-widget.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/palette.js"
    type: "module"
bodyClass: "bg-brand-bg text-brand-text antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col"
shell: true
navDrawerOnly: true
signOut: true
---
{# Every page here is public HTML, so this is only the frame. Everything personal is drawn by
   app/scripts/remember.js from the API, after sign-in. #}
<section class="app-page">
  <div class="app-prose">

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-brand-text">What I remember</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-8">Notes are kept in this site's database, and other users can't see them.</p>

  <p id="status" class="mb-6 text-sm" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <section aria-labelledby="memory-heading" class="card">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h2 id="memory-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-text"><label for="memory">Memory</label></h2>
        <p class="hint">On: the chat keeps conversations and writes short notes about you. Off: it reads and writes neither, and what is here stays until you delete it or it reaches 12 months.</p>
      </div>
      <input id="memory" type="checkbox" role="switch" class="switch" disabled>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="notes-heading" class="card mt-6">
    <h2 id="notes-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-text" tabindex="-1">Notes</h2>
    <ul id="notes" class="mt-3 divide-y divide-brand-border">
      <li class="py-3"><span class="skel h-4 w-2/3" aria-hidden="true"></span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="conversations-heading" class="card mt-6">
    <h2 id="conversations-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-text" tabindex="-1">Past conversations</h2>
    <ul id="conversations" class="mt-3 divide-y divide-brand-border">
      <li class="py-3"><span class="skel h-4 w-1/2" aria-hidden="true"></span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="forget-heading" class="card mt-6">
    <h2 id="forget-heading" class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-text">Forget everything</h2>
    <p class="hint">Deletes every note and every conversation. This cannot be undone.</p>
    <button type="button" id="forget" class="btn-secondary mt-4 text-sm">Forget everything</button>
    <div id="forgetConfirm" class="mt-4 hidden">
      <p class="text-sm text-brand-text">Delete all of it, for good?</p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-3">
        <button type="button" id="forgetYes" class="btn-primary text-sm">Yes, forget everything</button>
        <button type="button" id="forgetNo" class="btn-secondary text-sm">Keep it</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  </div>
</section>
